<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45192" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔστοχ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>well-aimed</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷδ᾽ ἂν εὐστόχῳ πτερῷ</span> (Elmsl.
			for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέτρῳ</span>) <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				76
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκόντιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					12.13
				</span></i>
			 (
				Sup.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πληγή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					6.25.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>aiming well</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσοι δὲ τόξοις
				χεῖρ᾽ ἔχουσιν εὔ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				195
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγχαις . . -ώτατοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					140
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				321
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔ. τὴν τοξικήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Nav.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χως</span>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, βάλλειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					1.4.8
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔστοχα βάλλειν,
			τοξεύειν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Parth.
				15.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Nigr.</u>
				36
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ώτατα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				67.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>making good shots</i>, i.e. <i>guessing well, hitting the
				right nail on the head</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Div.Somn.</u>
				464a33
			</span></i>; <i>shrewd</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1412a12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ephipp.
				14.1
			</span></i>, cj. in <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Epigr.</u>
				45
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουλευτήριον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
					201
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔστοχόν τι ἔνεστι τοῖς κακοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					950b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔ. ἐν ἀπαντήσεσιν</span>
			<i>ready</i> at repartee, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				6.74
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χως</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				792d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				639a5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2.108
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>successful</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					3.280
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐχαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.158.8
				</span></i>
			.</div>
